The PipeRoll seismograph readings in this directory, the Rekor witness bundles
under witness/, and the published feeds (advisories.json, series.json,
divergence.json, and the same files as served at seismo.piperoll.org) are
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0).

You are free to share and adapt this data for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit.

Attribution: cite "PipeRoll seismograph" with the reading date and the model
id, e.g.
  PipeRoll seismograph, reading 2026-10-17, deepseek-chat@deepseek -
  https://seismo.piperoll.org/models/deepseek-chat-deepseek/
Findings carry a ready-made citation line on their pages.

Readings are aggregate statistics only: no raw model text, no per-probe detail,
and never a ranking. Reuse that presents them as a rating or ranking of models
misrepresents the instrument (see CHARTER.md, "readings, not ratings").

Scope note: CHARTER.md section 8 reserves a licensed tier for attested
parametric-grade delivery and bulk machine feeds beyond what this repository
publishes. Everything committed here is and remains CC BY 4.0; the reserved
tier can only ever cover material that is not in this repository.

